@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `mw-il32-nouns`

-- Minimum Wage Law 5747-1987, s 1 (the definitions of the three minimum wages), s 5 and s 21.

§ `Section 1 — the monthly, daily and hourly minimum wage`

§§ `The monthly minimum wage`

-- The Law defines the monthly minimum wage as 47.5 percent of the average wage as it stands on
-- 1 April of each year, "and as increased under this Law" (the increases of s 4). The average wage
-- is defined by reference to s 1 of the National Insurance Law [Consolidated Version] 5728-1968,
-- which is not deposited, so the average wage is an input here. The increases under s 4 are carried
-- in the Minister's notices (s 6(3)); the figure in force is therefore in the published-figures module.
-- src:23 | ”שכר מינימום“, לחודש – 47.5 אחוזים מהשכר הממוצע כפי שהוא ב־1 באפריל של כל שנה וכפי שהוא מוגדל על פי חוק זה [note: (החל מאפריל 2023, 5,571.75 ש״ח לחודש)];
@ref Minimum Wage Law s 1 "שכר מינימום", לחודש (source line 23)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the share of the average wage that is the monthly minimum wage` MEANS 0.475

@ref Minimum Wage Law s 1 "שכר מינימום", לחודש (source line 23); before any increase under s 4
GIVEN `the average wage on 1 April` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the monthly minimum wage on 1 April, before increases under section 4, from` `the average wage on 1 April` MEANS
    `the share of the average wage that is the monthly minimum wage` TIMES `the average wage on 1 April`

§§ `The daily minimum wage`

-- A 25th of the monthly minimum wage for a six-day week, and a 21 2/3rd of it for a five-day week.
-- A 21 2/3rd is 65/3, so the five-day daily minimum wage is the monthly figure times 3, over 65.
-- The Minister may fix supplementary rules for the daily and hourly minimum wage that differ
-- from these (s 18(c)); the regulations of 5759-1998 that the consolidation mentions are not held
-- (NOTES.md, open questions).
-- src:24 | ”שכר מינימום יומי“ – החלק ה־25 של שכר המינימום לגבי עובד המועסק שבוע עבודה בן ששה ימים, והחלק ה־21 2 ⁄ 3 של שכר המינימום לגבי עובד המועסק שבוע עבודה בן חמישה ימים;
@ref Minimum Wage Law s 1 "שכר מינימום יומי" (source line 24)
GIVEN `the monthly minimum wage` IS A NUMBER
      `the working week`         IS A `The employee's working week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the daily minimum wage from` `the monthly minimum wage` `for` `the working week` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the working week`
    WHEN `a six-day working week`  THEN `the monthly minimum wage` DIVIDED BY 25
    WHEN `a five-day working week` THEN (`the monthly minimum wage` TIMES 3) DIVIDED BY 65

§§ `The hourly minimum wage`

-- A 186th of the monthly minimum wage.
-- src:25 | ”שכר מינימום לשעה“ – החלק ה־186 של שכר המינימום.
@ref Minimum Wage Law s 1 "שכר מינימום לשעה" (source line 25)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the hours in a month that the hourly minimum wage assumes` MEANS 186

@ref Minimum Wage Law s 1 "שכר מינימום לשעה" (source line 25)
GIVEN `the monthly minimum wage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the hourly minimum wage from` `the monthly minimum wage` MEANS
    `the monthly minimum wage` DIVIDED BY `the hours in a month that the hourly minimum wage assumes`

§ `Section 5 — an update does not reduce the minimum wage`

-- src:50 | סכום שכר המינימום לא יפחת בשום מקרה עקב עדכונו על פי חוק זה.
@ref Minimum Wage Law s 5 (source line 50)
GIVEN `the monthly minimum wage before the update` IS A NUMBER
      `the monthly minimum wage the update computes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the monthly minimum wage after an update, given` `the monthly minimum wage before the update` `and` `the monthly minimum wage the update computes` MEANS
    IF   `the monthly minimum wage the update computes` LESS THAN `the monthly minimum wage before the update`
    THEN `the monthly minimum wage before the update`
    ELSE `the monthly minimum wage the update computes`

§ `Section 21 — the amounts the Law itself prints`

-- "Notwithstanding the definition of minimum wage in s 1, the minimum wage shall be" 525 NIS on the
-- day the Law commenced (1 April 1987) and 551 NIS on 1 October 1987; s 21(a)(2) adds that this does
-- not derogate from s 4. They are the only shekel amounts in the Law's operative text.
-- src:174 | (א) על אף האמור בהגדרת ”שכר מינימום“ שבסעיף 1 יהיה שכר המינימום –
-- src:175 | (1) ביום תחילתו של חוק זה – סכום של 525 שקלים חדשים;
-- src:176 | (2) ביום ח׳ בתשרי התשמ״ח (1 באוקטובר 1987) – סכום של 551 שקלים חדשים; הוראה זו אינה באה לגרוע מהוראות סעיף 4.
@ref Minimum Wage Law s 21(a)(1) (source line 175)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the monthly minimum wage that section 21(a)(1) fixes for 1 April 1987` MEANS 525

@ref Minimum Wage Law s 21(a)(2) (source line 176)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the monthly minimum wage that section 21(a)(2) fixes for 1 October 1987` MEANS 551
